    <!-- Corrected 2026-08-30, both clauses. It claimed "no copy anywhere
         else", which a prior .vault export contradicts — VaultExporter streams every blob into the
         bundle, so an export taken before the removal still holds this file. The same overclaim was
         already corrected once for the trash purge dialog (vaultlist_trash_empty_no_undo_clause,
