    <!-- — an irreversible action, and a claim about where the file still
         exists. Both clauses were wrong until 2026-08-30: it said the copy "is deleted from this
         device" (the blob goes on the next unlock, not now) and that there is "no copy anywhere
         else" (an export or a snapshot may hold one — the same overclaim corrected for the trash
         purge dialog on 2026-07-29, which this path never inherited). -->
    <!-- SECURITY-COPY: tier A -->
    <string name="files_attachments_remove_dialog_body">The encrypted copy is removed from this vault, and erased from this device the next time you unlock. There is no undo here, though an earlier snapshot or backup may still hold it.</string>
